WEBVTT

00:00:29.578 --> 00:00:32.811
brought us computing power, data networks,

00:00:32.811 --> 00:00:35.146
unprecedented access

00:00:35.146 --> 00:00:37.499
to information and communication,

00:00:37.499 --> 00:00:40.774
and our lives have never been the same.

00:00:40.774 --> 00:00:42.387
Now we are experiencing

00:00:42.387 --> 00:00:44.151
another metamorphic change:

00:00:44.151 --> 00:00:46.338
the industrial Internet.

00:00:46.338 --> 00:00:49.313
It brings together intelligent machines,

00:00:49.313 --> 00:00:50.853
advanced analytics,

00:00:50.853 --> 00:00:53.219
and the creativity of people at work.

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:56.419
It's the marriage of minds and machines.

00:00:56.419 --> 00:00:58.975
And our lives will never be the same.

00:00:58.975 --> 00:01:01.968
In my current role, I see up close